{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قِيلَ", "translation": "it is said"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "تَعَالَوْا۟", "translation": "Come"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "مَآ", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "أَنزَلَ", "translation": "(has) revealed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَإِلَى", "translation": "and to"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّسُولِ", "translation": "the Messenger"}, {"text": "رَأَيْتَ", "translation": "you see"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ", "translation": "the hypocrites"}, {"text": "يَصُدُّونَ", "translation": "turning away"}, {"text": "عَنكَ", "translation": "from you"}, {"text": "صُدُودًۭا", "translation": "(in) aversion"}], "sahih": "And when it is said to them, \"Come to what Allāh has revealed and to the Messenger,\" you see the hypocrites turning away from you in aversion."}